Section 1 — Introduction & Organizational Overview
1.1 VANTIS Air Cargo — Mission and Identity
VANTIS Air Cargo is a premier virtual cargo carrier operating within the VANTIS global simulation network. Established with the ambition to define the gold standard of virtual cargo aviation, VANTIS operates a worldwide logistics network spanning six continents, connecting major freight hubs across the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Asia-Pacific (including Oceania), and Africa.
Our mission is unambiguous: to deliver cargo with the highest fidelity of real-world operational practice, pilot discipline, and dispatch intelligence available on the VANTIS network. VANTIS is not merely a virtual airline — it is a simulation of a world-class cargo carrier, executed with precision, staffed by professionals, and driven by data.
VANTIS operates under the sub-brand AirGrid Intelligence — the proprietary platform that serves as the operational nervous system of the carrier. Every route flown, every fuel plan computed, every cargo manifest reviewed, and every post-flight debrief processed flows through AirGrid.
The VANTIS identity is built on three foundational pillars:
●	Precision: Every operational decision is grounded in data, procedure, and verified intelligence.
●	Payload: Cargo is our product. Every flight is a commitment to our virtual customers and the integrity of the supply chain we simulate.
●	Performance: Our crews, dispatchers, and systems are held to the highest measurable standards on the network.

